OL,4,CSolomon Islands ends controversial     
OL,5,Csecurity pact with China for           
OL,6,CAustralian treaty                      
OL,7,GThe Solomon Islands has signed a       
OL,8,G"historic" treaty with Australia,      
OL,9,Gafter reportedly telling China it was  
OL,10,Gending a controversial security pact   
OL,11,Gsigned in 2022.                        
OL,13,FAt a press conference in Canberra on   
OL,14,FWednesday, Australian Prime Minister   
OL,15,FAnthony Albanese and Solomon Islands   
OL,16,Fcounterpart Matthew Wale said the new  
OL,17,Ftreaty would ensure that Australia was 
OL,18,Fthe Pacific nation's "security partner 
OL,19,Fof choice".                            
